<title>USA: FOB Gulf Grain - Soy basis firm, corn steady-weak.</title>
<headline>FOB Gulf Grain - Soy basis firm, corn steady-weak.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>FOB Gulf soybean basis values were slightly firmer on Tuesday as buying interest started to pick up after recent harvest-related weakness.</p>
<p>&quot;There were just more buyers today trying to cover themselves and I think some people realized prices were just too weak,&quot; one soybean trader said.</p>
<p>Corn prices were steady to weak with demand sluggish and supplies expected to pick up shortly as harvesting increases in the U.S. Midwest.</p>
<p>Wheat values were steady in quiet conditions.</p>
